# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the Python API for the latest version of Qiskit Fermions"
msgstr "Instala la API de Python para la última versión de Qiskit Fermions"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the Python API"
msgstr "Instalar la API de Python"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the Python API {#install-the-python-api}"
msgstr "Instalar la API de Python {#install-the-python-api}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prerequisites {#prerequisites}"
msgstr "Requisitos previos {#prerequisites}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "First, create a minimal environment with only Python installed in it. Use [Python virtual environments](https://docs.python.org/3/tutorial/venv.html).\n"
msgstr "Primero, crea un entorno mínimo con solo Python instalado. Usa [entornos virtuales de Python](https://docs.python.org/3/tutorial/venv.html).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Activate your new environment.\n"
msgstr "Activa tu nuevo entorno.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "There are two primary ways to install this package: from PyPI or from source. The preferred method is to install from PyPI:\n"
msgstr "Hay dos formas principales de instalar este paquete: desde PyPI o desde el código fuente. El método preferido es instalar desde PyPI:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install from PyPI {#install-from-pypi}"
msgstr "Instalar desde PyPI {#install-from-pypi}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install from source {#install-from-source}"
msgstr "Instalar desde el código fuente {#install-from-source}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you plan to develop in the repository you should install from source.\n"
msgstr "Si planeas desarrollar en el repositorio, debes instalar desde el código fuente.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "First, Qiskit must be installed in the same Python environment that you install `qiskit-fermions` in. The simplest way to do this is from PyPI, but you can install Qiskit from source if you want to.\n"
msgstr "Primero, Qiskit debe estar instalado en el mismo entorno de Python en el que instales `qiskit-fermions`. La forma más sencilla de hacerlo es desde PyPI, pero puedes instalar Qiskit desde el código fuente si lo deseas.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next, clone the `qiskit-fermions` repository.\n"
msgstr "A continuación, clona el repositorio `qiskit-fermions`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Now, install the Rust toolchain, upgrade pip, and enter the repository. Refer to the [Rust documentation](https://www.rust-lang.org/tools/install) for instructions on installing the toolchain.\n"
msgstr "Ahora, instala la cadena de herramientas de Rust, actualiza pip y entra en el repositorio. Consulta la [documentación de Rust](https://www.rust-lang.org/tools/install) para ver las instrucciones de instalación de la cadena de herramientas.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the remaining `build` dependencies. If you plan on developing in the repository, install the `dev` dependencies.\n"
msgstr "Instala las dependencias `build` restantes. Si planeas desarrollar en el repositorio, instala las dependencias `dev`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The next step is to install `qiskit-fermions` to the virtual environment.\n"
msgstr "El siguiente paso es instalar `qiskit-fermions` en el entorno virtual.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<DoqAdmonition type=\"note\" title=\"Hint\">\n"
msgstr "<DoqAdmonition type=\"note\" title=\"Sugerencia\">\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  You can also perform an editable install while still compiling the underlying Rust crate in `release` mode:\n"
msgstr "  También puedes realizar una instalación editable y seguir compilando el crate de Rust subyacente en modo `release`:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "</DoqAdmonition>\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  Some features rely on optional dependencies. To install all of them, use the `all` extra:\n"
msgstr "  Algunas funciones dependen de dependencias opcionales. Para instalarlas todas, usa el extra `all`:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  Refer to the `[project.optional-dependencies]` section of [pyproject.toml](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-fermions/blob/main/pyproject.toml) to see which dependency groups are available.\n"
msgstr "  Consulta la sección `[project.optional-dependencies]` de [pyproject.toml](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-fermions/blob/main/pyproject.toml) para ver qué grupos de dependencias están disponibles.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can optionally verify that the installation was successful. The simplest test is to try and import one of the classes provided by the `qiskit-fermions` package, as in the following example:\n"
msgstr "Opcionalmente, puedes verificar que la instalación se haya realizado correctamente. La prueba más sencilla es intentar importar una de las clases que proporciona el paquete `qiskit-fermions`, como en el siguiente ejemplo:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If this completes successfully, your installation worked.\n"
msgstr "Si esto se completa correctamente, tu instalación funcionó.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  You can also run the entire Python test suite:\n"
msgstr "  También puedes ejecutar toda la suite de pruebas de Python:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  To additionally run the tests that exercise optional dependencies, install the extras and use the `testoptional` target:\n"
msgstr "  Para ejecutar además las pruebas que ejercitan las dependencias opcionales, instala los extras y usa el objetivo `testoptional`:\n"
